    <item>
      <title>CemuUser8/mouse2joystick_custom_CEMU</title>
      <link>https://github.com/CemuUser8/mouse2joystick_custom_CEMU</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;An AutoHotkey Script to allow the use of Mouse and Keyboard control in CEMU. This uses vJoy and provides several additional features over regular keyboard control, like: the ability to control the camera with the mouse, toggle walking speed, in BotW use MouseWheel to change weapons, a separate Toggle key for ZL useful for locking onto a target …&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;</description>
      
